{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a relaxing tool called &quot;Drive and Unwind,&quot; designed to help you relax and accompany you during work and study. It features 2D parallax scrolling backgrounds that present different landscapes from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_25_\u4e0a\u5348_09_03_04.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will offer five car models (with more to be added in the future) for you to choose from (the DEMO version includes two). You can also control the car's direction, driving either left or right.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/1920_1080_DEMO3.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_11_38.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, we provide seven backgrounds (more to be added in the future) for you to choose from (the DEMO version includes two). You can select different backgrounds based on your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/1920_1080_DEMO4.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version, you can also choose the weather according to your mood. We offer sunny, snowy, and rainy weather options (this feature is not available in the DEMO version).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_15_31.png?t=1746487454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_16_01.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At launch, the full version will feature 69 songs across five music genres (LO-FI, POP, SONG, EAST ASIAN, BOSSA NOVA). The DEMO version provides 10 songs across three genres (LO-FI, POP, SONG).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_21_15.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main screen also allows users to quickly control the music options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_21_32.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, for those who use the Pomodoro technique, we offer a Pomodoro timer function that allows users to customize their work and break times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_03_00_05.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We sincerely recommend this to you and look forward to receiving feedback to help make this software even more popular and improve over time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678310?t=1746487454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678310?t=1746487454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/60da1190ecd6215b7a9bfafccbb093295964ccf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746487454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/60da1190ecd6215b7a9bfafccbb093295964ccf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746487454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a relaxing tool called &quot;Drive and Unwind,&quot; designed to help you relax and accompany you during work and study. It features 2D parallax scrolling backgrounds that present different landscapes from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_25_\u4e0a\u5348_09_03_04.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will offer five car models (with more to be added in the future) for you to choose from (the DEMO version includes two). You can also control the car's direction, driving either left or right.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/1920_1080_DEMO3.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_11_38.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, we provide seven backgrounds (more to be added in the future) for you to choose from (the DEMO version includes two). You can select different backgrounds based on your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/1920_1080_DEMO4.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version, you can also choose the weather according to your mood. We offer sunny, snowy, and rainy weather options (this feature is not available in the DEMO version).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_15_31.png?t=1746487454\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_16_01.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At launch, the full version will feature 69 songs across five music genres (LO-FI, POP, SONG, EAST ASIAN, BOSSA NOVA). The DEMO version provides 10 songs across three genres (LO-FI, POP, SONG).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_21_15.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main screen also allows users to quickly control the music options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_12_21_32.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, for those who use the Pomodoro technique, we offer a Pomodoro timer function that allows users to customize their work and break times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/extras/Drive_And_Unwind_2025_4_26_\u4e0b\u5348_03_00_05.png?t=1746487454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We sincerely recommend this to you and look forward to receiving feedback to help make this software even more popular and improve over time.</p>","developers":["Unwilling Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3675210","name":"Drive And Unwind"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678310/628cf25efe0cf94737fe7469aa7b2aad093b77a3/header.jpg?t=1746487454","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright Notice<br />\r\n\u00a9 2025 Unwilling Studio. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nAll content in this game, including but not limited to graphics, music, text, design, and code, is owned by Unwilling Studio or legally licensed. Unauthorized copying, modification, or commercial use is prohibited.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrademark Disclaimer<br />\r\nUnwilling Studio and all related trademarks are registered or unregistered trademarks of Unwilling Studio. Other mentioned trademarks are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128684,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128684/movie480.mp4?t=1746487452","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128684/movie_max.mp4?t=1746487452"},"name":"Drive And Unwind Demo Instructional Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128684/0ad5eb69be3896bc65fb8a76e8fade4200ebecb7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746487452","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128684/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746487452","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128684/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746487452"}}],"name":"Drive And Unwind Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating